        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqa guddimna! Inni Odu Dansa Yeso Kristo ta anini odeesu gula d'ugefacha teesani jabeesu indandaa, ammalle mullacha waan d'ossa ka ganna heddu d'ossani gula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
