          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo amma waan d'ossani suni ya mullisani t'aafi raagoota gula; ammalle seera Waaqa ka haga jiru jireenna tau gula ya gosa ch'ufa beesisani, aka nami ch'ufti d'ugefate ch'aqasu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.26"
            ]
